    - '*':
        reason: No fix available yet
        expires: 2026-11-09T09:00:00.000Z
        created: 2026-07-01T12:25:16.970Z
  SNYK-JAVA-ORGXERIALSNAPPY-19964087:
    - '*':
        reason: No fixed version available yet; snappy compression not enabled in Kafka config, so Snappy.compress is not reachable at runtime. Tracked in EID-6915.
        expires: 2026-11-09T09:00:00.000Z
        created: 2026-09-21T09:16:57.000Z
  SNYK-JAVA-ORGGLASSFISHJAXB-20883142:
    - '*':
        reason: >-
          Still no fixed version: re-checked Maven Central on 2026-11-09, 4.0.9 is the latest
          jaxb-core and jaxb-runtime release. Pulled in transitively via
          spring-boot-starter-data-jpa > hibernate-core 7.4.13 > jaxb-runtime, which only unmarshals
          Hibernate's own mapping files, not attacker-controlled XML. Track the upstream fix.
        expires: 2026-11-23T09:00:00.000Z
        created: 2026-10-16T09:00:00.000Z
  SNYK-JS-BRACES-19963945:
    - '*':
        reason: >-
          Still no fixed version: re-checked npm on 2026-11-10, 3.0.3 is the latest braces release and
          micromatch 4.0.8 requires ^3.0.3. Reached only through the Angular build tooling
          (@angular-devkit/build-angular > http-proxy-middleware > micromatch), never shipped in the
          bundle. Snyk proposes webpack-dev-server 6.0.0, which does not fix braces but replaces the
          path: that is a major upgrade of a transitive dev dependency we already pin to ^5.2.7 in
          package.json overrides, so it is deferred to the Angular CLI upgrade (EID-6533).
          Tracked in EID-6915.
        expires: 2026-11-23T09:00:00.000Z
        created: 2026-09-21T12:10:03.000Z
  SNYK-JS-PICOMATCH-21248802:
    - '*':
        reason: >-
          No fixed version exists yet (CVE-2026-112366); re-checked npm on 2026-11-10, 4.0.7 is still
          the latest picomatch release and the advisory names no fixed release. Reached through Angular
          schematics/build tooling (@angular-devkit/core), which matches glob patterns from project
          configuration rather than untrusted runtime input. Track the upstream fix. Tracked in EID-6992.
        expires: 2026-11-23T09:00:00.000Z
        created: 2026-10-20T00:00:00.000Z
  SNYK-JS-URIJS-19963963:
    - '*':
        reason: >-
          No fixed uri-js release exists (4.4.1 is the latest). Pulled in transitively
          via eslint > ajv 6; lint/build tooling only, never shipped in the bundle.
          Track the upstream fix.
        expires: 2026-11-13T09:00:00.000Z
        created: 2026-10-30T00:00:00.000Z
  SNYK-JS-HTTPCACHESEMANTICS-19964064:
    - '*':
        reason: >-
          No fixed http-cache-semantics release exists; the vulnerable copy is pulled in
          by the @angular/cli tooling and is only replaced by the Angular CLI 22 major
          upgrade (EID-6533). Build-time only.
        expires: 2026-11-13T09:00:00.000Z
        created: 2026-10-30T00:00:00.000Z
  SNYK-JS-HTTPCACHESEMANTICS-19964068:
    - '*':
        reason: >-
          No fixed http-cache-semantics release exists; the vulnerable copy is pulled in
          by the @angular/cli tooling and is only replaced by the Angular CLI 22 major
          upgrade (EID-6533). Build-time only.
        expires: 2026-11-13T09:00:00.000Z
        created: 2026-10-30T00:00:00.000Z
  SNYK-JS-FLAT-22148819:
    - '*':
        reason: >-
          No fixed flat release exists for this range: webpack-merge 6.0.1 (latest) requires
          flat ^5.0.2, and flat 6.0.1 is an ESM-only rewrite that cannot be required by
          webpack-merge. Reached only through the Angular build tooling
          (@angular-devkit/build-angular > webpack-merge), never shipped in the bundle.
          Track the upstream fix.
        expires: 2026-11-17T09:00:00.000Z
        created: 2026-11-03T09:00:00.000Z
